    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d314">

                <pb facs="0490" n="396" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg396"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Baron Fava to Mr. Olney.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Bar Harbor, Me.</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-08-11"><hi rendition="#italic">August 11,
                        1896</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Newspapers report three Italians taken from the prison of Hahnville, La., and
                    lynched by mob. Please kindly telegraph me the news you have received concerning
                    this dreadful outrage.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Fava.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
